  "normalizedText": "Thank You, Austin — Vuka\n\nAustin, Texas\n\nEst. 2011\n\nA letter to Austin\n\nThank you,\n\nAustin.\n\nAfter years of gathering, creating, and celebrating together, Vuka isn't going anywhere.\n\nFrom the Vuka team\n\nMay 2026\n\nFor over a decade, Vuka has been a home for weddings, launches, late nights, first meetings, big ideas, and the kind of community you can't manufacture. That part was never about the building. It was about you.\n\nThe walls come down, but everything we built inside them — the relationships, the mission, the way we gather — is moving with us into what's next.\n\nWe've got new projects in the works, and we want you with us when they're ready.\n\nPlay Gather Cultivate\n\nAlways.\n\nStay connected\n\nBe the first to know when we launch what's next.\n\nWe'll only email you about new Vuka projects. No spam.\n\nWith love, the Vuka team\n\n2011 – 2026 · Austin, Texas",
  "rawHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\">\n  <title>Thank You, Austin — Vuka</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"After fifteen years of gathering, creating, and celebrating together in Austin, Vuka isn't going anywhere. Be the first to know when we launch what's next.\">\n  <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://vuka.co/\">\n\n  <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Thank You, Austin — Vuka\">\n  <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"After fifteen years of gathering, creating, and celebrating together in Austin, Vuka isn't going anywhere. Be the first to know when we launch what's next.\">\n  <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://vuka.co/uploads/2020/01/CEREMONYONE-289_websize.jpg\">\n  <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://vuka.co/\">\n  <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n\n  <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/uploads/2022/07/cropped-VUKA_favicon1-270x270.png\">\n\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <!-- Montserrat (display, matches the geometric wordmark) + Lora (editorial italic warmth) -->\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400;1,500&display=swap\">\n\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/css/site.css?v=20260710000818\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <header class=\"header fade d-1\">\n    <div class=\"header-inner\">\n      <a class=\"wordmark\" href=\"https://vuka.co/\" aria-label=\"Vuka — home\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/vuka-wordmark.webp\" alt=\"Vuka\" width=\"1042\" height=\"209\">\n      </a>\n      <div class=\"meta\" aria-label=\"Austin, Texas. Est. 2011.\">\n        <span>Austin, Texas</span>\n        <span class=\"est\">Est. 2011</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main>\n\n    <!-- hero text -->\n    <section class=\"hero\">\n      <div class=\"hero-inner\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow reveal d-3\">A letter to Austin</p>\n        <h1 class=\"headline reveal d-4\">\n          Thank you,<br>\n          <span class=\"place\">Austin.</span>\n        </h1>\n        <p class=\"subhead reveal d-5\">\n          After years of gathering, creating, and celebrating together, Vuka isn't going anywhere.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- letter body -->\n    <section class=\"letter reveal d-6\">\n      <aside class=\"letter-side\" aria-label=\"From\">\n        <strong>From the Vuka team</strong>\n        <span>Austin, Texas</span>\n        <span>May 2026</span>\n      </aside>\n      <div class=\"letter-body\">\n        <p>For over a decade, Vuka has been a home for weddings, launches, late nights, first meetings, big ideas, and the kind of community you can't manufacture. That part was never about the building. It was about you.</p>\n<p>The walls come down, but everything we built inside them — the relationships, the mission, the way we gather — is moving with us into what's next.</p>\n<p>We've got new projects in the works, and we want you with us when they're ready.</p>\n\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- brand anchor -->\n    <section class=\"anchor reveal d-7\" aria-label=\"Vuka brand\">\n      <div class=\"anchor-inner\">\n        <div class=\"anchor-rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n        <h2 class=\"anchor-line\">\n          <span class=\"word\">Play</span><span class=\"word\">Gather</span><span class=\"word\">Cultivate</span>\n          <span class=\"always\">Always.</span>\n        </h2>\n        <div class=\"anchor-rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- form zone -->\n    <section class=\"form-zone reveal d-8\" aria-label=\"Stay connected\">\n      <div class=\"form-inner\">\n        <p class=\"form-eyebrow\">Stay connected</p>\n        <p class=\"form-intro\">Be the first to know when we launch what's next.</p>\n\n        <div class=\"hs-wrap\">\n          <div id=\"hubspot-form\"></div>\n          <p class=\"privacy hs-privacy\">We'll only email you about new Vuka projects. No spam.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"fade d-9\">\n    <div class=\"footer-inner\">\n      <p class=\"sign-off\">With love, the Vuka team</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\" aria-label=\"Social links\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/vuka.atx/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"Instagram\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\"0.9\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/></svg>\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/VUKAAUSTIN/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"Facebook\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"><path d=\"M14 8h2.5V5H14c-2 0-3.5 1.5-3.5 3.5V11H8v3h2.5v7H14v-7h2.5l.5-3H14V8.8c0-.5.3-.8.8-.8z\"/></svg>\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/vukaaustin\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"17\"/><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"7\" r=\"0.9\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/><path d=\"M12 17v-4.5c0-1.4 1.1-2.5 2.5-2.5S17 11.1 17 12.5V17\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"17\"/></svg>\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"mailto:connect@vuka.co\" aria-label=\"Email\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M3 7l9 6 9-6\"/></svg>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"year-range\"><strong>2011 – 2026</strong> &nbsp;·&nbsp; Austin, Texas</p>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n\n  <!-- HubSpot embed -->\n  <script charset=\"utf-8\" type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"//js-na2.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\"></script>\n  <script>\n    (function waitForHbspt(){\n      if (!window.hbspt || !window.hbspt.forms) { return setTimeout(waitForHbspt, 100); }\n      hbspt.forms.create({\n        portalId: \"5885213\",\n        formId: \"bc87d273-b231-449e-9e1c-a566ce713d64\",\n        region: \"na2\",\n        target: \"#hubspot-form\",\n        cssClass: \"vuka-hs-form\"\n      });\n    })();\n  </script>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n",
